# The Playbook's Rules page: the person's own rules beside the project's, the chief's offer to
# move one that names this repository, a sensitive rule, and the project group's menu.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
project storefront shop
core memoryAdd "{\"project\":\"$project\",\"entry\":{\"kind\":\"rule\",\"text\":\"Run pnpm check before every commit.\",\"goal\":null,\"sensitive\":false,\"store\":\"project\"}}"
core memoryAdd "{\"project\":\"$project\",\"entry\":{\"kind\":\"rule\",\"text\":\"Never print the Stripe keys in a reply.\",\"goal\":null,\"sensitive\":true,\"store\":\"project\"}}"
core memoryAdd "{\"project\":\"$project\",\"entry\":{\"kind\":\"rule\",\"text\":\"Keep each test in test/ beside the file it covers in src/.\",\"goal\":null,\"sensitive\":false,\"store\":\"personal\"}}"
core memoryAdd "{\"project\":\"$project\",\"entry\":{\"kind\":\"rule\",\"text\":\"Keep replies short.\",\"goal\":null,\"sensitive\":false,\"store\":\"personal\"}}"
chat Wren
settle 4
key cmd-alt-6
settle 3
snap rules
